{
  "upstreams": [
    {
      "package": "antd",
      "version": "6.6.4",
      "forkVersion": "6.6.4-chips.1",
      "forkPackage": "@chips/antd",
      "icons": {
        "package": "@ant-design/icons",
        "version": "6.3.4"
      },
      "patches": [
        {
          "id": "default-locale-zh-cn",
          "file": "antd@6.6.4.patch",
          "targets": [
            "es/locale/en_US.js",
            "es/date-picker/locale/en_US.js",
            "es/time-picker/locale/en_US.js",
            "es/pagination/Pagination.js",
            "lib/locale/en_US.js",
            "lib/date-picker/locale/en_US.js",
            "lib/time-picker/locale/en_US.js",
            "lib/pagination/Pagination.js"
          ],
          "reason": "fork 移除多语言与 locale 切换：上游在无语言上下文时回退到 en_US，Pagination 与日期/时间组件各自内置 en_US 默认值。补丁把上游的默认回退内容全部收敛为 zh_CN，并在日期组件内登记 dayjs 简体中文语言包，使组件文案、日期面板星期与月份名称固定为简体中文。",
          "spec": "薯片生态文档库/02-开发规范/08-@chips-ui共享层使用指南.md §5.2（fork 的改造：移除多语言与 locale 切换，组件文案与日期等格式固定为简体中文）；薯片生态文档库/01-架构设计/ADR/ADR-006-主题系统与多语言系统.md（废弃主题与多语言系统）",
          "status": "applied",
          "verifications": [
            {
              "file": "es/locale/en_US.js",
              "contains": "export { default } from './zh_CN';"
            },
            {
              "file": "lib/locale/en_US.js",
              "contains": "require(\"./zh_CN\")"
            },
            {
              "file": "es/date-picker/locale/en_US.js",
              "contains": "import 'dayjs/locale/zh-cn';"
            },
            {
              "file": "es/date-picker/locale/en_US.js",
              "contains": "dayjs.locale('zh-cn');"
            },
            {
              "file": "lib/date-picker/locale/en_US.js",
              "contains": "require(\"dayjs/locale/zh-cn\");"
            },
            {
              "file": "lib/date-picker/locale/en_US.js",
              "contains": "_dayjs.default.locale('zh-cn');"
            },
            {
              "file": "es/time-picker/locale/en_US.js",
              "contains": "import zhCN from './zh_CN';"
            },
            {
              "file": "lib/time-picker/locale/en_US.js",
              "contains": "require(\"./zh_CN\")"
            },
            {
              "file": "es/pagination/Pagination.js",
              "contains": "import zhCN from '@rc-component/pagination/locale/zh_CN';"
            },
            {
              "file": "lib/pagination/Pagination.js",
              "contains": "require(\"@rc-component/pagination/locale/zh_CN\")"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "package": "@rc-component/util",
      "version": "1.13.0",
      "forkVersion": "1.13.0-chips.1",
      "patches": [
        {
          "id": "use-delay-state-unmount-cleanup",
          "file": "@rc-component__util@1.13.0.patch",
          "targets": ["es/hooks/useDelayState.js", "lib/hooks/useDelayState.js"],
          "reason": "上游 useDelayState 只提供 cancelPending（raf.cancel / clearTimeout）却从不在组件卸载时调用，挂起的 setTimeout/raf 在组件卸载后仍会触发；antd 6.6.4 的 Form（useDebounce/ItemHolder/ErrorList）与 Button 经该 hook 排定定时器，vitest jsdom 环境拆除后回调触发即抛 Uncaught Exception（window is not defined），用例全过而进程退出码 1。补丁在 es/lib 两份产物各增补一个空依赖数组的 useEffect，在卸载时调用 cancelPending 清理挂起定时器，不改变任何行为语义。",
          "spec": "项目日志与笔记/工单067-rc工具库useDelayState卸载不清定时器致测试环境拆除后误触发/任务说明.md（根因证据、触发链与复现记录）；上游 react-component/util 修复合入并升级后，本补丁按 patches/README.md 流程退役。",
          "status": "applied",
          "verifications": [
            {
              "file": "es/hooks/useDelayState.js",
              "contains": "React.useEffect(() => () => {"
            },
            {
              "file": "lib/hooks/useDelayState.js",
              "contains": "React.useEffect(() => () => {"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
